{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id771877018?l=en"}, "name":{"label":"Yolandachar"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-01-16T01:54:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.6.0"}, "id":{"label":"12190593927"}, "title":{"label":"Rating: 1/5 - Terrible Experience"}, "content":{"label":"The app’s functionality is extremely frustrating:\n1. As an existing credit card holder, I wanted to open an account, but the button to do so was nearly impossible to find. It's incredibly frustrating that a simple task like this is so complicated. If I can't even open an account, how can I proceed with further actions or investments?\n2. The customer service chat constantly reloads. Following the customer support instructions, I had to search for the right button on the homepage, and it took multiple attempts to return to the chat. This creates a very inefficient and annoying user experience.\n3. The screenshot upload feature in the customer service chat barely works, making it almost useless.\n\nOverall, the app needs major improvements to enhance user experience and make customer support more efficient.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&l=en&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
