{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id603830429?l=en"}, "name":{"label":"TsangSTT"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-12-27T07:33:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.6.0"}, "id":{"label":"12112075751"}, "title":{"label":"Absolutely Frustrating Experience With This App!!!"}, "content":{"label":"I've been using this mobile banking app for a while, and while it has some good features, the constant redirection to promotion pages is absolutely infuriating! It makes managing my finances a total nightmare.\nI contacted customer service, and they had the nerve to say it's for marketing purposes and that I can close the promotions whenever I want. Seriously? So I have to hit 'close' on every single click? No way! This is beyond unacceptable! I really hope the team gets their act together and resolves this issue soon!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&l=en&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
