{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id563183404?l=en"}, "name":{"label":"Lil. C"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-31T21:29:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.5.5"}, "id":{"label":"11898125233"}, "title":{"label":"Cannot login"}, "content":{"label":"After its recent update, the login button didn’t work. I couldn’t login via the app. What’s the point of updating if it failed to work? Please give me back the older version.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&l=en&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id469798704?l=en"}, "name":{"label":"Asm950"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-25T00:55:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.5.4"}, "id":{"label":"11872238721"}, "title":{"label":"Trapped in a dead loop"}, "content":{"label":"I’m a credit card user and seeking to open a saving/ payroll account. Yet I was only met with failures when I tried to do so.\n\nI’ve encountered various errors during the integrated account application. Before the update, an error message prompted after I input my personal info and I couldn’t proceed.\n\nAfter the update, I’m stuck in an endless loading screen after the OTP verification.\n\nWhat’s the point of having a promotion calling for account opening via SC Mobile, while it’s impossible to do so?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&l=en&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
