{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id157679925?l=en"}, "name":{"label":"Pecbounce"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-09T04:11:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.5.3"}, "id":{"label":"11814220196"}, "title":{"label":"Make this make sense"}, "content":{"label":"I could not find an option to apply for an integrated deposit account within the app as a credit card user. According to customer service I have to delete the app to apply for it. After having to go through the trouble of scanning my ID card again, I have to change my username and password. I phoned customer support and they said there’s no way around it. Now I try to login with my new credentials but I failed so I tried my old login And that worked. It was only then that the option to apply for a deposits account suddenly appear on my dashboard. Soon, I got the message that my account was opened successfully and I was automatically logged out of the app and asked to delete and re-download the app again.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&l=en&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
